  "bodyHash": "NVzmAfLaOEM=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掠奪者入侵將 Minecraft 的掠奪者提升到全新層次！將近十多種擁有獨特能力的掠奪者，現在遊走於你的世界中。有些躲藏在危險的新建築裡，有些則會加入村莊襲擊，讓戰鬥變得更棘手。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">與更聰明的敵人作戰，尋找強力的戰利品，並探索隱藏的地點。新的挑戰意味著新的獎勵——一路樂趣無窮！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 新掠奪者</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">煉金術士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：擅長弓箭的專家，受激怒時會投擲滯留藥水。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">檔案管理員</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：利用附魔強化附近的掠奪者。害怕時會逃跑並施放法術。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">衝擊者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：手持盾牌的惡霸，會衝向玩家。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掠奪者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：遠程掠奪者，投擲致命的飛斧——從他身上奪取</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">白銀灌注飛斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">挑釁者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：使用弓箭的掠奪者，擁有基礎增益法術。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔮 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">巫師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：難以捉摸的施法者，能召喚危險的紫色火焰。掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">奇異之塵</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧟 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">死靈法師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：亡靈大師，能施放召喚法術壓制玩家。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">審判官</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：強大的掠奪者戰士，擁有堅固盾牌——先擊破他的盾牌才能打敗他！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火焰召喚者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：神秘的法师，看似無害——直到他釋放毀滅性的魔法。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">喚魔者</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：最強大的掠奪者！掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神聖寶石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，可用於</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灌注台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">升級附魔。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎭 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻術師</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：現在以全新外觀出現在生存模式！掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻術之塵</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏰 新建築</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">火焰召喚者小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：附有農場的小房子。生成於惡地。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🏰 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">掠奪者堡壘</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：有城牆、塔樓和強力掠奪者的防禦據點。生成於針葉林。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🗼 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻術師塔</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：多層塔樓，充滿掠奪者，頂層有幻術師 boss 戰。生成於針葉林和黑森林。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">迷宮</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：巨大的地下迷宮，充滿大量戰利品和更多掠奪者。尋找石廟入口！生成於大多數森林生態域。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛖 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">巫師小屋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：小型房屋建築。生成於黑森林。</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🛠️ 新裝備與物品</span></strong></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">灌注台</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：可將附魔升級至超越普通上限！每次使用需要一顆</span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">神聖寶石</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">白銀灌注飛斧</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：可投擲的斧類武器，由掠奪者低機率掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🕯️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">失落之燭</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：可幫助定位附近礦石，顯示其位置。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">視野號角</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">：讓附近的怪物發光，更快找到牠們！</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">用戶端與伺服器端皆需安裝</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果模組支援，可直接在遊戲內透過模組選單進行設定（需安裝 Fabric 版的 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 製作）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，還需要安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有設定檔案皆位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，檔名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，視設定類型而定。模組不一定包含所有類型的設定檔，甚至可能完全沒有。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://github.com/OhDricky\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Dricky</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 最初創作了精彩的 Illager Expansion 模組。Illager Invasion 是其作品的真實延續，包含了許多新增、改進、重製和錯誤修復。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fZekeSmith\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">ZekeSmith</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 在 Dricky 刪除原始碼後重新找到了 Illager Expansion 的原始碼，使得本次移植在 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspdx.org%252flicenses%252fMIT.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MIT</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 授權條款下得以實現。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/safrodev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">safrodev</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 對 Illager Expansion 1.19.2 版本的貢獻，視野號角的紋理取自於此。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 創作了許多精彩的全新紋理。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cut-through\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/cutthrough/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universal-bone-meal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eternal-nether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/straw-statues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/strawstatues/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-zoology\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horse-expert\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/horseexpert/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/linked-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/linkedchests/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/illagerinvasion/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
